        "encoding_method": "other",
        "encoding_details": "Dynamic graph community detection using Markov transition matrices and a Fourier–Markov operator; no explicit qubit-to-variable encoding is given. QAOA is used only as a refinement step for modularity optimization.",
        "objective_function": "Maximize modularity Q(FQ, C) over community partition C, where Q(FQ, C) = sum over communities c of sum_{i,j in c} (FQ(i,j) - gamma * k_i k_j / (2m)).",
        "constraints_handling": "Modularity-based refinement; QAOA-inspired search or simulated annealing mentioned for high-modularity partitions.",
